# Example scripts/paths.local.sh: one machine's answers for the paths that
# live outside this repository.
#
# Copy it to scripts/paths.local.sh, which is ignored by git, and fill in the
# lines a default does not already cover. Or skip all of it and run
#
#   scripts/discover-paths.sh
#
# which works the answers out and writes the file, along with the MSBuild half
# the build needs. Only a path nothing can discover has to be written by hand.
#
# scripts/paths.sh sources this before it computes anything, and every default
# there defers to a variable already set, so a line here wins over discovery
# and anything exported in the environment wins over a line here.
#
# That last part is what the :- in each line below is for, and it is not
# decoration: a plain assignment wins over the environment instead, which is
# the wrong way round and is worst where it is least visible. A CI runner
# names its install in the environment, and a file like this one left in the
# checkout would quietly send the run to a path that machine does not have.
#
# The values below are illustrations, not defaults. None of them is where
# anything is on your machine.

# A tModLoader install: the directory holding tModLoader.dll and
# tMLMod.targets. Discovery asks Steam for its library folders, so this is
# needed only for an install Steam does not know about, such as GOG's, or one
# outside a library folder entirely.
#TML_PATH="${TML_PATH:-$HOME/GOG/tModLoader}"

# Where a mod build leaves its .tmod: the Mods directory under the save path of
# the tModLoader build you develop against. The default is the dev build's,
# since the 1.4.5 line only exists as one; a stable or preview install saves
# under tModLoader or tModLoader-preview instead.
#MODS_SRC="${MODS_SRC:-$HOME/.local/share/Terraria/tModLoader-preview/Mods}"

# The ExampleMod directory inside a checkout of
# https://github.com/tModLoader/tModLoader. Only scripts/build-examplemod.sh
# wants it, for the calibration gate. discover-paths.sh looks for a checkout
# in the directories above this one; anywhere else, name it here.
#EXAMPLEMOD_SRC="${EXAMPLEMOD_SRC:-$HOME/code/tModLoader/ExampleMod}"
